000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TRELBATC.
000500 AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000800
000900**************************************************************
001000*                                                            *
001100*D  T R E L B A T C    THIS PROGRAMS PROCESSES ALL ITEMS     *
001200*D    PLACED IN A BATCH FILE (DATA SET DSHIPREL) THAT NEED   *
001300*D    TO BE PLACED ON SHIPPING RELEASES. ITEMS THAT BELONG   *
001400*D    ON THE SAME REQUIREMENT ORDER ARE COMBINED ON THE      *
001500*D    RELEASE. THE SHIPPING RELEASES ARE PRINTED AS WELL     *
001600*D    AS A CONTROL REPORT SHOWING ALL RELEASES CREATED AND   *
001700*D    AN ERROR KICKOUT REPORT SHOWING IDENTICAL ITEMS WITH   *
001800*D    DIFFERENT ACCTG. DATA.   THE RELEASES PRINT ON THE     *
001900*D    PO PRINTER THE REPORTS PRINT ON THE NEXT NEAREST       *
002000*D    CHARACTER PRINTER                                      *
002100*                                                            *
002200*   EXECUTABLE JOB STREAM:                                   *
002300*                           1) BXRLBATC                      *
002400*                                                            *
002500**************************************************************


      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *C
      *C  03/23/94  JEFF BUNGO  REQ #6488
      *C    GAVE SHIPPING RELEASES THEIR OWN PRINTER NUMBER INSTEAD
      *C    OF USING THE PO PRINTER.  IF THE SHIPPING RELEASE
      *C    PRINTER NUMBER IS NOT YET DEFINED THEN USE THE PO
      *C    PRINTER NUMBER AND UPDATE THE SHIPPING RELEASE PRINTER
      *C    WITH THE PO PRINTER NUMBER.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   SEPT. 94   JE COFFMAN  REQ #6527
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PROCESS CHAT NUMBERS THAT ARE STORED ON
      *C   THE SHIPPING RELEASE FILE.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   JAN. 96    CA YODER    REQ # 95-039
      *C   ADDED CALL TO "SRELVEND" TO SEE IF THE LOWEST-COST VENDOR
      *C   WAS CHOSEN FOR THE SHIPPING RELEASE.  IF NOT, AN AUDIT
      *C   RECORD WILL BE WRITTEN TO THE DATABASE MCFPCS6100.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   SEPTEMBER 1996  JE COFFMAN  REQ# 6619
      *C   EXPANDED DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   SEPTEMBER 8, 1997   JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER ROUTINE - MCXCBLERR.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   SEPTEMBER 25, 1997  CA YODER
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK IF PO SHIP/EXPECT DATES ARE EQUAL TO
      *C     SPACES SO THAT THE DATES AREN'T SHOWN AS "20      ".
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   10/27/1997          CA YODER
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO MOVE NOTIFY USER-ID FROM DSHIPREL TO
      *C     DPOITEM.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   03/03/1998          CA YODER
      *C     WITH THE CHANGE MADE TO ALLOW MORE THAN 12 RELEASES PER
      *C     BATCH, THIS PROGRAM WAS MODIFIED TO ACCEPT UP TO 999
      *C     SHIPPING RELEASES.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   05/28/98  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED CALL TO "SCALCBGT" TO CALCULATE THE CORRECT
      *C   BUDGET AMOUNT FOR THE PO.  DECATUR FOUND THAT THE
      *C   TAX WAS NOT BEING INCLUDED IN THE CALCULATION.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   9/17/98   CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PROCESS NEW DESCRIPTION LINE "99"
      *C   WHICH CONTAINS ALL 12 STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS FROM THE
      *C   BLANKET ORDER.  INSTEAD OF INCREASING THE SIZE OF
      *C   THE FILE IN THE MIDDLE OF A RELEASE, IT WAS DECIDED
      *C   TO JUST PUT THE STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS IN THE NEW
      *C   DESCRIPTION LINE.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   06/18/99   CA YODER
      *C   INDONESIA IDENTIFIED A PROBLEM WHEN TRYING TO MODIFY
      *C   PO ITEM WITH > 7 LINES OF DESCRIPTION.  FOUND THAT
      *C   THE DATAITM-LINE-NO FIELD WAS BEING WRITTEN WITH ZEROS
      *C   INSTEAD OF AN INCREMENTING SEQUENCE NUMBER.  THE PROBLEM
      *C   WAS THAT SUB2 IS 4 DIGITS MOVING TO A 2-DIGIT FIELD,
      *C   CAUSING ONLY THE FIRST 2 DIGITS TO BE MOVED TO THE
      *C   SEQUENCE NUMBER.  CORRECTED PROBLEM.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   09/09/99  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST
      *C   MOVE MSTORERM MARKET COST TO UNIT VALUE FIELD FOR
      *C   REPAIR PURCHASE ORDER ITEMS.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   09/21/99  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST
      *C   ADDED CALL TO "SCHKRLSV" TO VERIFY THAT THE VALUE OF THE
      *C   SHIPPING RELEASE IS >= THE MINIMUM ORDER VALUE FOR THE
      *C   VENDOR, IF THE SWITCH IS SET IN MPLTINFO (PODL).
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   11/08/99  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO IGNORE CALL TO "SCHKRLSV" IF THE RELEASE
      *C   IS A REPAIR ORDER (SUFFIXED WITH M, W OR C).
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   03/01/00  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST  (D. STUBBS)
      *C   REMOVED LOGIC TO UPDATE MARKET COST ON REPAIR ORDERS.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C   MAY 2001  JE COFFMAN
      *C   ADDED CODE AT LAWTON'S REQUEST TO PROCESS THE RELEASES
      *C   BASED ON WHETHER THEY HAD BEEN ISSUED AS BATCH OR
      *C   OR IMMEDIATE (OPTION PS2) OR IF THEY HAD BEEN ISSUED
      *C   AS HOLD (PS2X).
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C  04/03/2003    DCR  DAN RAUCH
      *C  DCR01 - ADDED LOGIC FOR PO LOGGING
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C  01/07/2004    DCR  DAN RAUCH
      *C  DCR02 - ADDED LOGIC FOR ORDER CONSOLIDATION
      *C          1) CALL "END OF BATCH" CL
      **************************************************************

