076200     CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
076300     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT       TO  PRT-DATE.
076400     MOVE DATE-FORMATTED-TIME-OUT  TO  PRT-TIME.
076500     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT         TO  CUR-DATE.
076600     MOVE YY OF CUR-DATE       TO  BUD-YY.
076700     MOVE MM OF CUR-DATE       TO  BUD-MM.
076800
076900 1-H-X.
