088400                                       ERR-LINE-CTR.
           IF SAVE-CHECK-RLS-VAL = "Y"
               PERFORM 61B-READ-SHIPREL   THRU  61B-RS-X
           ELSE
087300         PERFORM 61-READ-SHIPREL    THRU  61-RS-X.
087400
087500     SORT SORT-RELEASE-NUM-FILE
087600         ON ASCENDING KEY  S-BLANKET-NO,
087700                           S-ITEM-NO,
087800                           S-ITEM-SEQ-NO
087900            USING REL-FILE
088000            GIVING REL-FILE.
